-- Tests of the month's salary by the law (l4/lib/salary-root.l4). They sit
-- beside it and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22); the calculator's
-- "example" button reads its case, `a State teacher in a primary school`,
-- from here.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `salary-root`

§ `בדיקות השכר לחודש לפי הדין`

§§ `המקרים`

-- The facts §1.1 does not ask about, for a teacher employed by the State
-- and holding no role. The five facts the month supplies (the month, the
-- 5% step's population, the combined salary, תוספת 2001 and תוספת 2008 of
-- today) are given here too, and `the case of the month` replaces them.
`a State teacher in a primary school` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2000
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 9600
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 288
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `heads the junior division`        IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS FALSE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 0
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 0
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

-- In the upper division of post-primary education, represented by the
-- secondary teachers' organisation: the agreement of 24.1.2008 speaks to
-- the 2008 supplement.
`a State teacher in an upper division` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2000
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS TRUE
        `in the upper division`           IS TRUE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS TRUE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 9600
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 288
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `heads the junior division`        IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS FALSE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 0
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 0
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

-- §1.1's own worked example: a full-time teacher in March 2012, combined
-- salary 10,000, a 1994 supplement of 200.
`the month` MEANS `a full-time teacher in March 2012`

-- A State teacher of Ofek Hadash (MMS-555), placed in the reform's tables
-- by education, seniority and grade, a full position; and a principal of
-- the reform, by rank, complexity level and grade.
GIVEN `salary month` IS A DATE
      education IS A `the education the tables ask`
      post IS A `the post in the reform's tables`
      seniority IS A NUMBER
      grade IS A NUMBER
      level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `teaching case`
DECIDE `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` `salary month` education post seniority grade level IS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS `salary month`
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 0
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 0
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `heads the junior division`        IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS TRUE
        `the post in the reform`          IS post
        `the education`                   IS education
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS seniority
        `the grade in the tables`         IS grade
        `the school's complexity level`   IS level

-- The month as typed: a full position, whatever combined salary the form
-- was given (10,000), which the law's answer replaces.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `salary month`
DECIDE `a full month typed on` d IS
    `salary month` WITH
        `month`                                       IS d
        `full-position combined salary`               IS 10000
        `position fraction of the month`              IS 1
        `is a principal`                              IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was postponed` IS FALSE
        `1994 supplement per full position`           IS 200

`an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015) `with a first degree` `a teacher in the tables` 10 5 0
`a new Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2016` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2016) `with a first degree` `a teacher in the tables` 1 1 0
`an Ofek Hadash teacher with a second degree in October 2023` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023) `with a second degree` `a teacher in the tables` 10 5 0
`an Ofek Hadash teacher in June 2012` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) `with a first degree` `a teacher in the tables` 10 5 0
`a certified principal of Ofek Hadash in October 2023` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023) `non-academic of certified rank` `a principal in the tables` 0 2 3
`an academic principal of Ofek Hadash in October 2023` MEANS
    `a State teacher of Ofek Hadash` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023) `with a first degree` `a principal in the tables` 0 2 3

§§ `לפי הדין`

-- Where only the takanon speaks to the 2008 supplement, the law's month is
-- §1.1's: 11,432, as 1.1.l4 asserts.
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `a State teacher in a primary school` `the month` (LIST) EQUALS 11432
#ASSERT `the module that governs the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher in a primary school` `the month` EQUALS "takanon-1-1"

-- Where the agreement of 24.1.2008 speaks, it governs (the takanon's
-- introduction: a collective agreement prevails over the takanon): 494.40
-- for the 2008 supplement instead of §1.1's 500; and the 2011 supplement,
-- §92 of the completion agreement's 4% on the combined salary and the 2001
-- and 2008 supplements the law gives (MMS-555), is 431.776 instead of
-- §1.1's 432: the month is 5.824 less.
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the 2008 supplement` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month` EQUALS 494.4
#ASSERT `the module that governs the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month` EQUALS "2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model"
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month` (LIST) EQUALS 11426.176

-- Every instrument that speaks is listed, with what it says.
#ASSERT `the modules that speak to the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month` EQUALS LIST "takanon-1-1", "2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model"
#ASSERT `what each says of the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month` EQUALS LIST 500, 494.4
#ASSERT `the item is contradicted in the month` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher in an upper division` `the month`

§§ `השכר המשולב לפי טבלאות אופק חדש`

-- A teacher of the reform (MMS-555): whatever the form was given, the law's
-- combined salary is the cell of the table in force — annex א'3 of 1.1.2015
-- at seniority 10 and grade 5; a new teacher (seniority 1, grade 1) on
-- annex א'3 of 1.9.2016; annex א'4 of 1.9.2022 for a second degree; and a
-- principal's annex א'9 at level 3 and grade ב.
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) EQUALS 8996
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `a new Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2016` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2016)) EQUALS 5805.65
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `an Ofek Hadash teacher with a second degree in October 2023` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023)) EQUALS 10250.12
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `an academic principal of Ofek Hadash in October 2023` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023)) EQUALS 20636.68
#ASSERT `the module that governs the item` `the combined salary of a full position` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) EQUALS "tables-in-force-common"
-- At half a position, half the cell (§1.1א).
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`the same month at position` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) 0.5) EQUALS 4498

-- Where the corpus holds no table, the law has no answer, the form's
-- figure stands, and the page says why: the completion agreement's tables
-- of 1.1.2012, and a non-academic principal's from 1.9.2022.
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in June 2012` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012)) EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT ((`why the item has no answer in the month` `the combined salary of a full position` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in June 2012` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012)))
    EQUALS "הטקסט חסר בקורפוס: טבלאות השכר של הסכם ההשלמה מיום 1.1.2012 (MMS-116)")
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the combined salary` `a certified principal of Ofek Hadash in October 2023` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023)) EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT ((`why the item has no answer in the month` `the combined salary of a full position` `a certified principal of Ofek Hadash in October 2023` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023)))
    EQUALS "הטקסט חסר בקורפוס: טבלאות השכר של מנהלים וסגנים שאינם אקדמאים מ־1.9.2022 (נספחים א'8 ו־א'9 להחלטת ועדת המעקב מיום 14.1.2025)")
-- Off the reform nothing speaks to it and nothing is missing: §1.1's input.
#ASSERT `why the item has no answer in the month` `the combined salary of a full position` `a State teacher in a primary school` `the month` EQUALS ""

-- The base agreement's conversion took the 2008 supplement into the table
-- salary: for a teacher of the reform it answers 0, and prevails over the
-- takanon's 5% (convention instruments.converted-supplements).
#ASSERT `the component that governs` `the 2008 supplement` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `what each says of the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) EQUALS LIST 449.8, 0
#ASSERT `the module that governs the item` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `an Ofek Hadash teacher in March 2015` (`a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2015)) EQUALS "base-agreement-44"

