§§ `גמולי התפקיד בחודש`

-- The roles the case holds are paid in the month (convention
-- reading.role-allowances-in-the-month): a State teacher of the reform with
-- a second degree, seniority 10 and grade 5, in October 2023 (annex א'4 of
-- 1.9.2022: 10,250.12, and the Ofek 2022 supplement of annex ג'4, 614.87,
-- which §5.4 of the agreement of 19.10.2022 counts in the percentage
-- supplements on the combined salary: a base of 10,864.99), holding the
-- roles given.
GIVEN coordinator IS A BOOLEAN
      interns IS A NUMBER
      head IS A BOOLEAN
      roles IS A NUMBER
      approved IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `teaching case`
DECIDE `an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` coordinator interns head roles approved IS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 0
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 0
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 0
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 0
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS coordinator
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS interns
        `heads the junior division`        IS head
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS roles
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS approved
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS TRUE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a second degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 10
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 5
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

`October 2023 typed` MEANS `a full month typed on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2023)

-- A pedagogical coordinator mentoring one intern, the number of roles left
-- at 0: he holds two, the cap pays two — the agreement of 19.10.2022's 8%
-- (869.1992) and the agreement of 19.3.2017's 2.4% (260.75976) of the base.
`a coordinator mentoring one intern` MEANS `an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` TRUE 1 FALSE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT `the role allowance paid in the month` `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` `a coordinator mentoring one intern` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS 869.1992
#ASSERT `the role allowance paid in the month` `the mentor's allowance rate` `a coordinator mentoring one intern` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS 260.75976
#ASSERT `the item's answer in the month` `the role allowances counted` `a coordinator mentoring one intern` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS JUST 2
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `a coordinator mentoring one intern` `October 2023 typed` (LIST) EQUALS 11994.94896

-- Holding the junior division's head too, with no approval for a third
-- role: §39(ב) pays two, the highest — the head's 20% (2,172.998: §5.4
-- counts the Ofek 2022 supplement in it too) and the coordinator's 8%; the
-- mentor's 2.4% is held and not paid.
`three roles held, none approved` MEANS `an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` TRUE 1 TRUE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT `the role allowance paid in the month` `the junior-division head's allowance` `three roles held, none approved` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS 2172.998
#ASSERT `the role is held in the month` `the mentor's allowance rate` `three roles held, none approved` `October 2023 typed`
#ASSERT `the role allowance paid in the month` `the mentor's allowance rate` `three roles held, none approved` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `three roles held, none approved` `October 2023 typed` (LIST) EQUALS 13907.1872
-- With the district manager's approval, all three.
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` (`an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` TRUE 1 TRUE 0 TRUE) `October 2023 typed` (LIST) EQUALS 14167.94696

-- Three roles, the third his class's education, listed among §1.1ו's
-- allowances at 10% (1,086.499): it is taken as paid and fills a place, so
-- of the coordinator's and the mentor's the cap pays the higher.
`a class educator, coordinator and mentor` MEANS `an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` TRUE 1 FALSE 3 FALSE
#ASSERT `the places the cap leaves the roles held` `a class educator, coordinator and mentor` `October 2023 typed` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `a class educator, coordinator and mentor` `October 2023 typed` (LIST `class education at 10%`) EQUALS 12820.6882

-- No role held: the month is the cell and the Ofek 2022 supplement,
-- whatever the root says the roles' rates are.
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` (`an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` FALSE 0 FALSE 0 FALSE) `October 2023 typed` (LIST) EQUALS 10864.99
#ASSERT `the item's answer in the month` `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` (`an Ofek Hadash teacher in October 2023 holding` FALSE 0 FALSE 0 FALSE) `October 2023 typed` EQUALS JUST 0.08

§§ `התוספות האחוזיות`

-- Every component of §1.1א–ה is the root's now (MMS-555); where no
-- instrument speaks to it for a case, §1.1's figure is what is left.
#ASSERT all `answered by the root` `§1.1's components`

-- The percentage allowances are §1.1's, on top of the components.
#ASSERT `the salary that governs` `a State teacher in a primary school` `the month` (LIST `class education at 10%`) EQUALS 12575.2
